{"seq":3,"slug":"graph-embeddings","title":"图嵌入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/network-graph-analysis/models/graph-embeddings","wordCount":1541,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"图嵌入\">图嵌入</h1><p>传统机器学习吃的是行向量，可图里的节点天生没有坐标——它只有「和谁相连」。图嵌入要做的，就是给每个节点学出一个稠密向量，让结构上相近的节点在向量空间也相近，从而让 KNN、聚类、分类器、乃至 <a href=\"link-prediction\">链接预测</a> 都能直接接管。它是 <a href=\"../metrics/centrality\">中心性</a> 那种「手工设计一个数」的彻底升级：不再人工定义重要性，而是让模型自动学一整个表示。这一篇讲清从随机游走到图神经网络的三代方法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>图嵌入方法可按「如何定义节点的相似」分代：基于随机游走的浅层方法、基于矩阵分解的方法、以及基于消息传递的图神经网络。下图展示这条演进。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  EMB[图嵌入] --&gt; WALK[随机游走类]&#10;  WALK --&gt; DW[DeepWalk]&#10;  WALK --&gt; N2V[node2vec]&#10;  EMB --&gt; MF[矩阵分解类]&#10;  MF --&gt; LE[拉普拉斯特征映射]&#10;  EMB --&gt; GNN[图神经网络]&#10;  GNN --&gt; GCN[GCN]&#10;  GNN --&gt; SAGE[GraphSAGE 归纳式]&#10;  GNN --&gt; GAT[GAT 注意力]&#10;  N2V --&gt; SKIPGRAM[Skip-gram 复用 word2vec]&#10;  SAGE --&gt; INDUCTIVE[可处理新节点]\">graph TD\n  EMB[图嵌入] --&gt; WALK[随机游走类]\n  WALK --&gt; DW[DeepWalk]\n  WALK --&gt; N2V[node2vec]\n  EMB --&gt; MF[矩阵分解类]\n  MF --&gt; LE[拉普拉斯特征映射]\n  EMB --&gt; GNN[图神经网络]\n  GNN --&gt; GCN[GCN]\n  GNN --&gt; SAGE[GraphSAGE 归纳式]\n  GNN --&gt; GAT[GAT 注意力]\n  N2V --&gt; SKIPGRAM[Skip-gram 复用 word2vec]\n  SAGE --&gt; INDUCTIVE[可处理新节点]</pre><p>下表对照三代方法的关键差异。「归纳式」指能否给训练时没见过的新节点生成嵌入。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>相似性定义</th>\n<th>用节点属性</th>\n<th>归纳式</th>\n<th>可扩展性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>DeepWalk / node2vec</td>\n<td>随机游走共现</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拉普拉斯特征映射</td>\n<td>谱/邻接相似</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>低（特征分解）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GCN</td>\n<td>邻居特征聚合</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>半</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GraphSAGE</td>\n<td>采样邻居聚合</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"deepwalk-与-node2vec-把图当语言\">DeepWalk 与 node2vec：把图当语言</h2><p>第一代实用嵌入借了自然语言处理的东风。DeepWalk 的洞察是：在图上做随机游走，得到的节点序列就像句子里的词序列；于是把每条游走当一个「句子」，套用 word2vec 的 Skip-gram，就能学出节点向量——经常一起出现在游走里的节点，向量会靠近。</p>\n<p>node2vec 在此基础上加了两个参数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 来调节游走的「广度优先 vs 深度优先」：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>游走偏好</mtext><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>返回上一节点</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mn>1</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>走向共同邻居</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>走向更远处</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{游走偏好} = \\begin{cases} 1/p &amp; \\text{返回上一节点} \\\\ 1 &amp; \\text{走向共同邻居} \\\\ 1/q &amp; \\text{走向更远处} \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">游走偏好</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:4.32em;vertical-align:-1.91em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.35em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎩</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.192em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.316em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.316em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 316\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V316 H384z M384 0 H504 V316 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.15em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎨</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.292em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.316em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.316em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 316\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V316 H384z M384 0 H504 V316 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.6em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎧</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.85em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.41em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.97em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.53em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.91em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.41em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">返回上一节点</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.97em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">走向共同邻居</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.53em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">走向更远处</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.91em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>小 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 让游走更像 DFS、捕捉「结构等价」（角色相似），大 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 让游走更像 BFS、捕捉「同质性」（社区相似）。这给了实践者一个旋钮去匹配任务。这类方法的优点是简单、可扩展、效果稳健；根本局限是<strong>直推式</strong>（transductive）——它只为训练时见过的节点学向量，新来一个节点必须重训，且完全无法利用节点自身的属性特征。</p>\n<h2 id=\"谱方法与矩阵分解\">谱方法与矩阵分解</h2><p>另一条更早的路线把嵌入看成矩阵分解问题。拉普拉斯特征映射用图拉普拉斯矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = D - A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 是度对角矩阵，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 是 <a href=\"../foundations/data-representation\">图数据表示</a> 里的邻接矩阵）的最小若干个非零特征向量作为坐标，让相连节点的嵌入尽量接近。</p>\n<p>事实上，DeepWalk、node2vec 后来被证明本质上都等价于对某个由游走概率构成的矩阵做隐式分解——随机游走方法和矩阵分解方法殊途同归。谱方法的好处是有清晰的数学解释、与谱聚类、特征向量中心性（见 <a href=\"../metrics/centrality\">中心性</a>）同源；致命缺点是要做特征分解，复杂度高达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^3)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 量级，无法扩展到大图，因此实践中大图基本不用纯谱方法，而是用它的近似或随机游走替代。</p>\n<h2 id=\"图神经网络-消息传递\">图神经网络：消息传递</h2><p>第三代是图神经网络（GNN），核心是<strong>消息传递</strong>：每个节点反复聚合邻居的特征、更新自己的表示，第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 层就能感知 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 跳邻域的信息。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>h</mi><mi>v</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mi>σ</mi><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>AGG</mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msubsup><mi>h</mi><mi>u</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>:</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mtext> </mtext><msubsup><mi>h</mi><mi>v</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_v^{(k)} = \\sigma\\!\\left( W \\cdot \\text{AGG}\\big(\\{ h_u^{(k-1)} : u \\in N(v) \\} \\big) + B\\, h_v^{(k-1)} \\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.185em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">AGG</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)}</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>不同 GNN 的区别在聚合函数 AGG：GCN 用归一化求和、GraphSAGE 用可学习的均值/池化、GAT 用注意力加权。GNN 相比随机游走方法的根本飞跃是<strong>能用节点属性</strong>——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>h</mi><mi>v</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_v^{(0)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1614em;vertical-align:-0.1166em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5834em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1166em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 可以是节点的真实特征（用户画像、文本嵌入），结构和属性被一起学进表示。</p>\n<p>其中 <strong>GraphSAGE</strong> 尤其重要：它通过「采样固定数量邻居 + 学习聚合函数」实现<strong>归纳式</strong>学习，训练好后能直接给从没见过的新节点生成嵌入，不必重训——这对节点不断涌入的真实系统（新用户、新商品）是刚需，也是它战胜直推式 node2vec 的关键场景。需要注意 GNN 的两个老问题：层数太深会<strong>过平滑</strong>（所有节点表示趋同）、大图上的邻居爆炸需要采样或分块（CSR 表示与采样配合，见 <a href=\"../foundations/data-representation\">图数据表示</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"嵌入怎么用\">嵌入怎么用</h2><p>学出嵌入只是手段，下游任务才是目的。三类典型用法：<strong>节点分类</strong>——把节点向量喂给分类器预测标签（如识别欺诈账号）；<strong>链接预测</strong>——用两端向量的内积或 Hadamard 积判断是否连边，这正是 <a href=\"link-prediction\">链接预测</a> 里的嵌入方法；<strong>可视化</strong>——用 UMAP/t-SNE 把高维嵌入降到二维观察社区结构，但要警惕降维会扭曲距离，这一点在 <a href=\"../practice/visualization\">网络可视化</a> 里展开。</p>\n<p>工具上，node2vec 在 NetworkX 生态有现成实现，GNN 则用 PyTorch Geometric 或 DGL（见 <a href=\"../practice/tools-libraries\">工具与库</a>）。一个实践提醒：评估嵌入质量时，链接预测任务的数据切分必须避免泄露——在「补边之前」的图上训练嵌入，否则指标会虚高，这与 <a href=\"link-prediction\">链接预测</a> 的评估陷阱是同一回事。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>图嵌入给节点学稠密向量，让结构相近的节点在向量空间也相近，是中心性「手工一个数」的升级。</li>\n<li>DeepWalk/node2vec 把随机游走当句子、复用 Skip-gram，简单可扩展，但直推式、不用节点属性；node2vec 的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p,q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 调节 BFS/DFS 偏好。</li>\n<li>谱方法/矩阵分解有清晰数学解释、与谱聚类同源，但 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^3)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 难扩展；随机游走方法本质是其隐式分解。</li>\n<li>图神经网络靠消息传递聚合邻居，能融合节点属性；GraphSAGE 的采样+聚合实现归纳式、可处理新节点。</li>\n<li>注意 GNN 的过平滑与邻居爆炸问题；嵌入用于节点分类、<a href=\"link-prediction\">链接预测</a>、可视化。</li>\n<li>评估嵌入要避免数据泄露，工具见 <a href=\"../practice/tools-libraries\">工具与库</a>，降维可视化的失真见 <a href=\"../practice/visualization\">网络可视化</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"图嵌入","id":"图嵌入"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"DeepWalk 与 node2vec：把图当语言","id":"deepwalk-与-node2vec-把图当语言"},{"level":2,"text":"谱方法与矩阵分解","id":"谱方法与矩阵分解"},{"level":2,"text":"图神经网络：消息传递","id":"图神经网络-消息传递"},{"level":2,"text":"嵌入怎么用","id":"嵌入怎么用"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"链接预测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/network-graph-analysis/models/link-prediction"},"next":{"title":"工具与库","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/network-graph-analysis/practice/tools-libraries"}}